WEBVTT

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:34.990
<b>From One Year to the Next</b>

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.660
<b>Coffee Shop</b>

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:40.260
It'll be Christmas soon.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.530
That's right.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.800
I'd like to do some kind of event.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:47.160
Something to bring in more customers.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:48.790
Yeah...

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:52.290
Why don't we put on another play 
on Christmas Eve, then?

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:57.170
It would be the Hitotose Troupe's 
second performance!

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:57.960
Yeah.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:01.870
But we don't have much time until Christmas,

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:06.450
so we probably won't be able 
to do one as big as last time.

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.940
We won't have time to practice.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.110
A short play is fine, too!

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.290
Let's do it!

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:13.170
Right, Principal Hina-chan?

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:14.110
Yeah!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.950
I bet our second play will go 
even better than the first!

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:20.860
That settles it! It'll be about...

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.110
Hmm, let's see...

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:24.700
For the end of the year...

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:26.700
Maybe <i>Chushingura</i>?

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.670
Since it'll be Christmas,

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:31.570
maybe it should be more of a Christmas story.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:34.440
A Christmas story, huh?

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:36.590
Okay, how about this?

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:41.330
A tragic love story between 
Santa Claus and a reindeer.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.970
Wherefore are thou a reindeer?

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:44.820
Like that.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.720
Or maybe...

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:51.380
A revenge drama about Prince Santa Claus 
driven mad with the need for vengeance.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.850
Get to the convent!

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:54.110
Aww!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.970
How about that?

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:58.850
Um, what do those have 
to do with Christmas,

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:00.740
other than having Santa and a reindeer?

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:03.530
I like it! Santa and his reindeer!

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.620
I'll have to start preparing 
the costumes right away!

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:10.160
Mayu-chan's switch just flipped on.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.000
Yeah.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.750
I can't wait until the costume fitting!

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.610
Oh, I know! You'll need dresses, too, right?

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:18.650
Uh, Mayu-chan...

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:19.390
What?

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:24.230
Like I said before, we won't have much time,

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:27.260
so I was thinking of borrowing 
costumes from the theater club.

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:31.220
D'oh...

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.780
Mayu-chan's switch just flipped off.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:32.650
Yeah.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.770
Okay, then, how about something 
based on <i>A Christmas Carol</i>?

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:39.100
That might be nice.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:43.410
On Christmas Eve night, a cruel, 
miserly girl is haunted by a ghost,

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.490
who asks Santa Claus and 
his reindeer for a certain gift...

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:50.490
You won't budge on Santa 
and the reindeer, huh?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:51.160
Nope!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.690
Wait, but if it has that many characters,

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:56.670
won't we be short on actors?

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:02.500
We have the landlady, Hina-chan, 
and Yua-chan, right?

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.960
You're right.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:09.430
If we can get a real reindeer, 
we should be able to manage.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:13.840
If a regular deer will work instead of 
a reindeer, I might be able to get one.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.050
W-We can do that?!

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:19.030
Animals do like Hina-chan, after all.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.820
Do you think you could summon 
Santa while you're at it?!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:26.200
Huh?! Um, um...

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:29.560
I-If you think my grandpa 
would be good enough...

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:33.050
Oh, I don't know if I can act...

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:33.050
Hina-chan, you don't need to 
worry about it that much.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.710
<b>Used Bookstore
 Hitotose</b>

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.710
<b>~ The Next Day ~</b>

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.460
I heard the news!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.960
We're doing a play on Christmas Eve, right?

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:44.970
Let me help... you... with that...

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:46.470
Thanks.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.450
Oh, welcome, Yua-chan!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.220
Huh?

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:50.720
So...

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.980
I went straight to the theater club 
to borrow costumes!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.280
They're in the bag.

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:00.710
And I also came up with a practice schedule!

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:01.730
Thanks.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.240
Here, Hinako.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.400
And you, Kuina.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.740
And Mayuki-senpai, here's yours.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:09.110
Oh, Chiaki-senpai! 
Please try on your costume!

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:13.360
I think it'll fit, but it's a little different
 from normal costumes, so...

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:15.500
Okay. I'll try it on.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.630
Is that a spirit costume?

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.450
It's pretty extreme.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:31.640
I-It fit perfectly when I tried it on...

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:35.640
Is this what you call an 
"unequal bodily society"?

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.150
<b>Fujimiya 
Girls' 
High 
School</b>

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:41.270
We'll be holding a play on the 24th!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:42.310
Please take one!

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:43.280
Here you go.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.140
How cute!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:46.780
Please take one! And be sure to come!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.150
Here you go!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.230
It'll be really fun, so please come!

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.410
Sensei!

00:05:51.220 --> 00:05:52.380
Here you go!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:58.170
<b>The Hitotose Troupe 
December 24 
Mini Drama</b>

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:58.170
<b>Place: Coffee Shop Hitotose 
Starting at 5:00 PM</b>

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:58.170
December 24th... A mini-drama...

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.530
You're putting on another play 
at Hitotose Manor?

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:03.130
Yes! We hope you'll come watch it, too!

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.880
Of course.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.640
What kind of play is it?

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:09.300
It's based on <i>A Christmas Carol</i>.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.180
That's certainly a classic.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.170
We'll have a real deer.

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:17.040
And Chiaki-senpai will strip!

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:17.460
Huh?

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.520
Not really.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:20.060
Yes, really.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.810
Which is it?

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.780
You really did call a deer.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:32.320
Okay, you two,

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:35.520
take the deer with you 
to draw in customers, okay?

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.260
O-Okay...

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:44.090
W-We'll be holding a play 
here in our shop today!

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:49.090
P-Please come and... w-watch...

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:53.390
Wh-Why did I have to dress like this, too?

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:01.250
Hina-chan, I can't do this! 
It's too embarrassing!

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:05.520
Hina-chan's a scarecrow already?!

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:09.110
I have to try harder!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.560
A deer!

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:15.740
So it is!

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:19.620
How cute!

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:22.120
Oh, wow!

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:25.620
Hina-chan, Mayu-chan, how goes the...

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:30.380
The deer's doing all the work.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.130
<b>Performance
 in Session</b>

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:37.640
Oh, Sensei, welcome.

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.630
Looks like business is booming.

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.520
Yeah, it's a full house!

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:42.520
Please... Please grant my wish!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.710
Your play is getting a good response.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:47.400
I cannot grant the wish of a miser like you!

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.400
No, it's not so much the play.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:51.400
I beseech thee, grant her wish!

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:51.400
It's the landlady's costume

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.110
and the deer that are popular.

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:59.080
Wow. So you actually have 
a real deer in the play.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.370
Yeah.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:04.140
Next time, I'll try to win people over 
with the actual story!

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.170
A deer... a deer...

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:12.930
Maybe I'll try to use that 
in my next drama script.

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:13.910
Huh?

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.680
Thank you for coming!

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:24.110
Everyone, since this was 
your second performance,

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:27.230
your acting felt much more 
natural than in the first.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:28.690
It was wonderful.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:30.180
Oh, gosh!

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:32.800
Well, that's to be expected!

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:36.410
Being praised by Sensei 
really gives me an appetite!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.980
It should give you inspiration, 
not an appetite!

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:40.410
Oh, yeah.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:45.580
Well, I'll have to take my leave now.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.690
Huh? You're leaving already, Ruri-chan?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.390
There's still lots of cake 
and other things left.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.590
I've had plenty.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.520
Oh, I forgot!

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:59.720
You need to go home and get to bed, 
or Santa won't come, right?

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:02.850
I'll go to bed early today, too!

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:09.660
Hina-chan, do you actually 
still believe in Santa?

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:12.330
Hinako-san is right.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:14.570
I need to go home and get to bed early,

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:16.990
or Santa Claus won't come.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:18.230
Yeah!

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:21.440
Bye, Ruri-chan!

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:24.620
Don't forget to hang your stocking!

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:26.500
Okay.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.280
Sensei is so mature...

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.250
Yeah.

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:35.010
Mayu-chan, I'll go buy presents later.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:39.340
Yeah. We don't want to 
crush Hina-chan's dreams.

00:09:57.010 --> 00:09:58.660
Oh, Hinako!

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:01.660
Mom! I'm home!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.220
Welcome home!

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:04.330
Welcome home.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.840
Yes, welcome home.

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:07.150
Have you been well?

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.420
Yes!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.290
Oh? Your face looks different, somehow.

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:15.240
You usually get all nervous and stiffen up.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:18.450
I've been doing theater in Tokyo,

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.930
so I don't get nervous as easily anymore.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:26.110
That's why I can talk 
this normally to people now!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:33.320
I won't let anyone call me a scarecrow...

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:37.320
Hina-chan! Happy New Year!

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:45.200
Look at that! It's the 
first sunrise of the year!

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:48.580
Kuu-chan, you're so energetic 
this early in the morning.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:51.940
Well, the start of a new year 
brings all kinds of firsts!

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:53.960
I can't help being excited!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.070
F-Firsts?

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:56.960
Yeah!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.320
The first snack!

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.840
Yum!

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.110
The first mochi!

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:02.470
Delicious!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.140
The first bite snitched!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.470
Tangy!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.270
And the first book!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:09.980
<b>Discourse on 
Decadence</b>

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.980
All you're doing is eating.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.860
Happy New Year, everyone.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.980
Happy New Year!

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:21.380
Oh, by the way, you were in my 
first dream of the year, Mayu-chan.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.610
Yeah? What was it about?

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:27.540
A giant Mayu-chan looking down on Mt. Fuji.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.500
Yay!

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:32.690
I-I was that big?

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:34.500
<i>Mayu-chan looks happy.</i>

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:38.130
But Mt. Fuji was actually a miniature,

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:44.260
and you were actually even smaller 
than you are in real life.

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:44.260
Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.540
What?

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:49.640
<i>She's shocked!</i>

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:57.120
Do you all have any goals 
for the coming year?

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:58.020
I do!

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:01.410
My goal is to read 300 books this year!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:04.780
I'm going to work on my acting.

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:11.540
I guess mine is still to be able to talk 
in front of people without getting nervous.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:15.970
And mine is to keep supporting Hina-chan 
and the others as their senpai.

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:19.050
I want to get the coffee shop's 
business on the right track, too.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.460
<i>She's drinking so much milk...</i>

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:27.300
<i>I guess what she really 
wants to do is get taller.</i>

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.310
<b>Please continue 
to support 
Coffee Shop Hitotose 
this year!</b>

00:12:30.260 --> 00:12:33.310
Oh, Kuu-chan, Mayu-chan...

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.540
Are you going out somewhere?

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.440
We're going to visit our families.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:39.190
Huh? Really?

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:39.970
Yeah.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:42.070
We'll be back in about two days, though.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:47.320
Two days? Won't you just spend 
all that time on trains and buses?

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:51.330
Uh... Our families live in Tokyo.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:53.650
They're only about an hour away.

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:55.460
O-Oh, I see!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.130
I've always wondered this...

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:02.050
Where in the countryside does 
Hina-chan live, exactly?

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.840
I'm not sure, either...

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:11.350
We'll be going now, Hina-chan.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.330
I'll be so lonely...

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.030
We'll be back before you know it.

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:19.630
This isn't goodbye forever.

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.200
Oh, I forgot!

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.610
Just a second.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:30.460
If you get lonely, 
just imagine this doll is me.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.490
Thanks, Mayu-chan!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.880
And I'll send this little one 
with you in return.

00:13:36.450 --> 00:13:38.250
I can't take something that's alive...

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.440
Here, I'll give you this book!

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:42.630
I'd rather not take something half-eaten...

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:54.210
Miss Landlady, I'll help you!

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.520
Thanks.

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:06.490
It's so quiet with 
both of them gone, isn't it?

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.320
Uh huh.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:11.940
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.160
<i>The conversation isn't going anywhere!</i>

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:18.070
<i>I have to think of something 
she'd enjoy talking about!</i>

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:21.570
<i>If there's one thing I know 
she likes, it's theater.</i>

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:25.890
<i>But I don't know that much about theater...</i>

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:29.770
<i>What else does she like?</i>

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:35.850
<i>I don't really know anything 
about her at all, do I?!</i>

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.540
Hina-chan, what's wrong?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.360
I-I want to know

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.480
everything about you!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:52.190
So, what do you want to know?

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:53.870
Stuff about acting?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.360
Y-Yeah...

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:58.790
Okay. Ask me anything.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.370
A-Anything?

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:05.500
<i>When she puts it that way, 
there are too many things I'd like to ask...</i>

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:10.260
<i>Like how she moves her body so gracefully,</i>

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:14.260
<i>or how she prepares physically 
for each of her roles...</i>

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:18.520
<i>Um... um...</i>

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:21.690
I want to know about your body!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.600
Hina-chan, calm down.

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:35.560
Um, so what do you like, other than theater?

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:37.580
Other than theater?

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:40.780
Well...

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:42.830
I do like small animals.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.690
Small animals?

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:49.090
Yeah. When I was little, 
I had a golden hamster.

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:52.840
It was so small, and its eyes were so round,

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.470
and its golden fur was so soft...

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:57.970
It was so cute.

00:15:58.210 --> 00:16:01.840
Golden hamsters 
really are cute, aren't they?

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:02.480
Yeah.

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:08.660
<i>Huh? Small, round eyes, golden...</i>

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:12.490
<i>That sounds like something 
I've seen before...</i>

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:17.220
Are you all right, Mayu-chan?

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:18.870
Y-Yeah...

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:22.770
Oh, right. I'm leaving for my 
part-time job this afternoon.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:24.540
Do you want to come?

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:28.330
Part-time? You have a part-time job?

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:28.880
Yeah.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.590
Every year on New Year's,

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:34.690
I go and help a friend of mine 
who likes theater.

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:36.720
I see!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:39.530
And what kind of work is it?

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:42.770
Well, serving customers, I guess...

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.580
<i>Serving customers?!</i>

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:48.770
<i>I'll have a chance to overcome my nervousness
 right from the start of the year!</i>

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.140
What do you say?

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.280
I'll go!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:59.980
<i>This is not what I had envisioned...</i>

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:07.040
<i>The landlady really does look good 
in anything she wears, though.</i>

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:10.920
<i>All the men here can't take 
their eyes off of her.</i>

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:14.880
<i>Th-There's someone suspicious...</i>

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:19.550
<i>But that hairstyle...</i>

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.060
Yua-chan?

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:27.060
Wh-Why are you here?!

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:30.780
Huh? I'm working here with the landlady.

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:32.570
Wh-What?!

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:36.610
She gets to see Chiaki-senpai 
in her miko outfit up close...

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:38.580
I'm so jealous!

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:39.410
Huh?

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:42.980
Oh, did you come to see the landlady?

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:44.580
Yes! Got a problem with that?!

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:48.130
Then why don't you go talk to her 
instead of sneaking around?

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.340
It's a fan's job to watch over her 
from the shadows!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.090
Huh? Yua-chan?

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.470
What brings you here?

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.760
Ch-Ch-Chiaki-senpai...

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.340
She said she was looking at you
 in your miko outfit.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.700
Hinako!

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:05.200
Want to try being a miko with us, Yua-chan?

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.230
Huh? Huh?!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.540
How about it?

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:10.110
I-I'd love to!

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:15.060
<i>Yes! I get to see Chiaki-senpai 
in her miko outfit up close!</i>

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.040
Um...

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:19.950
Are you sure we don't 
need to ask the priest?

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.050
I think it'll be fine.

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:26.620
Having two cute mikos 
should bring in more visitors.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:30.420
Don't put unnecessary pressure on me!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:38.000
Did you eat lots of mochi?

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.260
Really?

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.930
I ate lots, too.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.790
The landlady talks 
a lot more than I realized.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.800
Wow, four? That is a lot.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.770
Oh, you didn't know?

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:48.550
She's really outgoing with young kids.

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:50.490
Oh...

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.770
<i>Come to think of it...</i>

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:56.870
<i>I guess she does talk a lot 
with Mayu-chan and Kuu-chan.</i>

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.230
Yua-chan...

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:02.950
I wish I were smaller.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.170
Huh?

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:06.540
Are you picking a fight?

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:13.650
Thanks for helping me today, you two.

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:14.640
Sure!

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.370
Um, Miss Landlady...

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.380
I'd...

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:23.640
...like to talk with you more!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.930
Would that bother you?

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:35.720
It doesn't bother me at all.

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:38.600
I'm happy you feel that way.

00:19:39.090 --> 00:19:40.450
Really?

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:41.700
Yep.

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.450
Thank you!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.890
No fair, Hinako!

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:05.970
<i>I'm glad I got to know the landlady 
better today, even if it was just a little.</i>

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:13.480
<i>I have a feeling I'll be able to 
talk with her even more tomorrow.</i>

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:19.230
<b>Hitotose</b>

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:25.370
Mayu-chan's doll is all wet with my drool...

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:32.800
My goodness, Goro. You really 
love Mayu, don't you?

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:33.620
S-Stop!

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:39.810
New Year's is almost over...

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:41.880
It went by so fast.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:47.390
<i>In three months, 
I'll have been here for a year.</i>

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:50.520
<i>I wasn't sure how it would go at first,</i>

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:53.710
<i>but then I met everyone, 
started our theater troupe,</i>

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:56.020
<i>became friends with Yua-chan...</i>

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.900
<i>I was in the play
 at our culture festival, too,</i>

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:02.780
<i>and the Hitotose Troupe 
had its first performance.</i>

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:05.780
<i>So much has happened.</i>

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:09.780
<i>But I think it's all helped me 
grow up a little bit...</i>

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:17.080
<i>Or maybe not.</i>

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:17.920
<i>But...</i>

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:21.220
<i>I'll keep trying my best at everything!</i>

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:22.050
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:24.760
I'm back.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.800
I'm back!

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:27.550
Kuu-chan! Mayu-chan!

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.550
Welcome back, you two.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.700
I bought lots of souvenirs.

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:33.670
This is Tokyo's specialty, Ahiru!

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:36.310
Huh?! I got Ahiru, too...

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:37.940
So we have lots!

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:39.890
Let's all eat them right now!

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:43.440
Huh? Shouldn't we put our things away first?

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:46.070
Eating the year's first souvenir 
takes priority!

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:49.050
Eating really is all you ever do, isn't it?

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:50.020
Yep!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.720
Let's hurry and eat these!

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:54.950
Yeah, let's eat!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:35.140
<b>The Place We Longed to Reach</b>

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:29.250
I came to Hitotose Manor because 
I wanted to change myself,

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:33.030
and I met precious friends there 
who can never be replaced.

00:23:33.520 --> 00:23:36.980
I'll keep working toward my goal 
along with all the people I love!

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:39.430
Next time, "The Place We Longed to Reach."
